# tldw stores API keys in chrome.storage.local via the Settings screen, NOT in a
# build-time env file. This file exists only to document the providers involved.
#
# OpenRouter — used for summary generation (F7). Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Transcription provider — used only for the audio fallback (F5, Phase 3).
# OpenAI Whisper: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# TRANSCRIPTION_API_KEY=
